<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17943" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτοσχεδι-άζω</span></b> , aor.
		part.
		
			Pass.
		
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ασθείς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Stratt.
					4
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτοσχέδιος</span>):—<i>act</i> or <i>speak
				offhand, extemporize,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Cra.</u>
				413d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mx.</u>
				235c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				3.5.21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc.,
				<i>extemporize,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ δέοντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.138
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				5.2.32
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> mostly in
			bad sense, <i>act, speak,</i> or <i>think unadvisedly,</i>
			v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Euthd.</u>
				278e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐ. καὶ καινοτομεῖν περὶ τῶν θείων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Euthphr.</u>
					5a
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ap.</u>
				20c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				9.41
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				61.43
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Euthphr.</u>
					16a
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1326b19
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τὰ τῶν Ἐλλήνων σώματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					3.158
				</span></i>
			.</div>
